{"thought": "I need to fix the duplicate slug logic. The counter should count ALL occurrences of a slug (including those filtered by max_level or empty slug) before assigning the suffix. Currently I'm only counting after filtering. I need to track seen slugs from the original headings list, before filtering.", "action": {"tool": "edit_file", "args": {"path": "src/textkit/table_of_contents.py", "old": "    headings = extract_headings(markdown)

